# Browser security headers for every page and file on the site.
#
# Read by Cloudflare Workers static assets (and Netlify) the same way
# _redirects is; never served as a file.
#
#   Strict-Transport-Security  always use HTTPS here for the next year, so a
#                              coffee-shop network can't downgrade a visit.
#   X-Content-Type-Options     a file is only ever what its type says.
#   X-Frame-Options and        no other site may load these pages in a frame
#   frame-ancestors            (clickjacking). Nothing on this site frames
#                              itself either.
#   base-uri, object-src       close two old ways of injecting script without
#                              restricting the scripts the app actually loads.
#   Referrer-Policy            other sites see only curbcallpro.com, never the
#                              page or its query string.
#   Permissions-Policy         features the app never uses are switched off.
#                              Geolocation stays on: "Use My Location" needs it.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(), usb=(), payment=(), serial=(), bluetooth=()
